    "format_version": 2,
    "info": {
        "api_language": "C++",
        "brief": "Input action API",
        "description": "Iterate the resolved actions from the most recent binding update. Action\nstorage is private; getters read the iterator's current action. Getters require\nthe last ActionIterateNext call to have returned true.\n\nCall only on the engine thread. Iterators and actions are borrowed until\nthe next binding update starts or the context is destroyed. Reloading bindings\npreserves the completed batch.\nIteration is read-only, allocation-free and independent between listeners.",
        "description_html": "<p>Iterate the resolved actions from the most recent binding update. Action\nstorage is private; getters read the iterator's current action. Getters require\nthe last ActionIterateNext call to have returned true.</p>\n<p>Call only on the engine thread. Iterators and actions are borrowed until\nthe next binding update starts or the context is destroyed. Reloading bindings\npreserves the completed batch.\nIteration is read-only, allocation-free and independent between listeners.</p>",
